%% title: The steps of recording a payment
%% desc: Pick the student and type the amount received. The money is split across the oldest bills first. A discount needs admin approval. Extra cash becomes change or credit balance. In the end one payment and one invoice are made.
flowchart TD
  S["Pick the student<br/>(up to 10 siblings)"]:::admin --> A["Type the amount received"]:::admin
  A --> SP["Money is split across bills<br/>oldest due date first"]
  SP --> D{"Is there a discount?"}:::note
  D -->|"Yes"| AP["Admin approves"]
  D -->|"No"| M["Choose payment method"]:::admin
  AP --> M
  M --> C{"More cash than due?"}:::note
  C -->|"Yes"| CH["Return change<br/>or keep as credit balance"]
  C -->|"No"| R["Press Record"]:::admin
  CH --> R
  R --> OUT["One payment and one invoice<br/>print or send the receipt"]
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
